+Comprehension targets are lexical bindings: the first iterable is evaluated in its containing
+scope, while target stores and inner temporal observations retain the distinct comprehension
+scope. A definite deletion is represented separately from an unknown value; a deleted module
+binding can still fall through to the existing builtin resolver, while a deleted lexical local
